      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i keep getting this SettingWithCopyWarning in my pandas notebook when i try to add a new column to a dataframe i subsetted earlier. i thought i was just doing a simple slice but now it's throwing this warning every time i run the cell. can u explain why this is happening and how i can actually fix it properly?",
