      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tip. i tried adding .copy() like you said but now i'm seeing a different issue where my changes aren't actually reflecting in my main dataframe, they're just staying in that temp_df. it's like the connection to the original data is totally severed. why does pandas make it so hard to just modify a slice directly without it being so finicky?",
